========================================================================
SUMMARY: first single-norm-lattice 3N-crossover by family
family                         deg  N_cross  count
grid t=5  = KNIGHT (deg8)        8      >60      -
grid t=25 (deg12)               12      >60      -
grid t=65 (deg16)               16      >60      -
eisen t=1 (penny, deg6)          6      >60      -
eisen t=7 (sqrt7, deg12)        12       32     97
eisen t=13 (AMP, deg12)         12       34    104
========================================================================
Anchors (AMP arXiv:2412.11914 + Engel): u(n)<=3n all n<=24 => N*>=25;
u(28)>=85>84 => N*<=28. A lattice family crossing at N in {25,26,27}
would lower the ceiling; crossing >28 shows Engel's record is NON-lattice.
